s overriding `_compute_cost`, mirroring the existing `AStar3D` tests\r\n* Adding/removing points and edges, including directed and bidirectional connections\r\n* Empty graph behavior (`get_point_count`, `has_point`, `get_point_ids`, path queries)\r\n* Point properties: position, weight scale, disabled state, and re-adding existing points\r\n* Capacity and ID helpers: `get_available_point_id`, `get_point_capacity`, `reserve_space`, `clear`\r\n* Geometry queries: `get_closest_point` and `get_closest_position_in_segment`\r\n* Path behavior with weight scales, disconnected graphs, partial paths, and disabled points\r\n* Invalid input handling for all public API `ERR_FAIL_COND` branches, wrapped with `ERR_PRINT_OFF` / `ERR_PRINT_ON` to keep test output clean\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: I used Claude Opus 4.7 to help draft the PR description and review my code before submission. I wrote the tests myself, but used it to polish wording and double-check coverage.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open",